    "engine": "knitr",
    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"In-class Exercise 9\"\n\nauthor: \"xh.zhang\"\ndate-modified: \"last-modified\"\nexecute:\n  echo: true\n  eval: true\n  warning: false\n  freeze: true\n---\n\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Installing Required Packages\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\npacman::p_load(tidygraph, ggraph,\n               visNetwork, lubridate, clock,\n               tidyverse, graphlayouts)\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n### Data Import and Preparation\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Import data\nGAStech_nodes = read_csv(\"data/GAStech_email_node.csv\") \nGAStech_edges = read_csv(\"data/GAStech_email_edge-v2.csv\")\n\n# Convert date format and add weekday\nGAStech_edges = GAStech_edges %>%   \n  mutate(SendDate = dmy(SentDate)) %>%   \n  mutate(Weekday = wday(SentDate, label = TRUE, abbr = FALSE))\n\n# Aggregate work-related emails\nGAStech_edges_aggregated <- GAStech_edges %>%   \n  filter(MainSubject == \"Work related\") %>%   \n  group_by(source, target, Weekday) %>%     \n  summarise(Weight = n()) %>%   \n  filter(source!=target) %>%   \n  filter(Weight > 1) %>%   \n  ungroup()\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n## Creating Network Objects with tidygraph\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Create tbl_graph object\nGAStech_graph = tbl_graph(nodes = GAStech_nodes, \n                          edges = GAStech_edges_aggregated,\n                          directed = TRUE)\n\n# Change active tibble and sort edges by weight\nGAStech_graph %>%   \n  activate(edges) %>%   \n  arrange(desc(Weight))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n# A tbl_graph: 54 nodes and 1372 edges\n#\n# A directed multigraph with 1 component\n#\n# Edge Data: 1,372 × 4 (active)\n    from    to Weekday Weight\n   <int> <int> <ord>    <int>\n 1    40    41 星期六      13\n 2    41    43 星期一      11\n 3    35    31 星期二      10\n 4    40    41 星期一      10\n 5    40    43 星期一      10\n 6    36    32 星期日       9\n 7    40    43 星期六       9\n 8    41    40 星期一       9\n 9    19    15 星期三       8\n10    35    38 星期二       8\n# ℹ 1,362 more rows\n#\n# Node Data: 54 × 4\n     id label           Department     Title           \n  <dbl> <chr>           <chr>          <chr>           \n1     1 Mat.Bramar      Administration Assistant to CEO\n2     2 Anda.Ribera     Administration Assistant to CFO\n3     3 Rachel.Pantanal Administration Assistant to CIO\n# ℹ 51 more rows\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n## Static Network Visualization with ggraph\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Basic network graph\nggraph(GAStech_graph) +   \n  geom_edge_link() +   \n  geom_node_point()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Apply graph theme\ng = ggraph(GAStech_graph) +    \n  geom_edge_link(aes()) +   \n  geom_node_point(aes())  \ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-2.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Use Fruchterman-Reingold layout\ng = ggraph(GAStech_graph, layout = \"fr\") +   \n  geom_edge_link(aes()) +   \n  geom_node_point(aes())  \ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-3.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Color nodes by department\ng = ggraph(GAStech_graph, layout = \"nicely\") +    \n  geom_edge_link(aes()) +   \n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = Department, size = 3))  \ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-4.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Edge thickness mapped to Weight\ng = ggraph(GAStech_graph, layout = \"nicely\") +   \n  geom_edge_link(aes(width=Weight), alpha=0.2) +   \n  scale_edge_width(range = c(0.1, 5)) +   \n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = Department), size = 3)  \ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-5.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n## Faceted Network Graphs\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Facet by Weekday\nset_graph_style()  \ng = ggraph(GAStech_graph, layout = \"nicely\") +    \n  geom_edge_link(aes(width=Weight), alpha=0.2) +   \n  scale_edge_width(range = c(0.1, 5)) +   \n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = Department), size = 2)  \ng + facet_edges(~Weekday) +\n  th_foreground(foreground = \"grey80\", border = TRUE) +\n  theme(legend.position = 'bottom')\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Facet by Department\ng + facet_nodes(~Department) +\n  th_foreground(foreground = \"grey80\", border = TRUE) +\n  theme(legend.position = 'bottom')\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-2.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n## Network Metrics Analysis\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Compute and visualize betweenness centrality\ng = GAStech_graph %>%\n  mutate(betweenness_centrality = centrality_betweenness()) %>%\n  ggraph(layout = \"fr\") + \n  geom_edge_link(aes(width=Weight), alpha=0.2) +\n  scale_edge_width(range = c(0.1, 5)) +\n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = Department, size=betweenness_centrality))\ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Direct access to centrality in ggraph\ng = GAStech_graph %>%\n  ggraph(layout = \"fr\") + \n  geom_edge_link(aes(width=Weight), alpha=0.2) +\n  scale_edge_width(range = c(0.1, 5)) +\n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = Department, size = centrality_betweenness()))\ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-2.png){width=672}\n:::\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Community detection\ng = GAStech_graph %>%\n  mutate(community = as.factor(group_edge_betweenness(weights = Weight, directed = TRUE))) %>%\n  ggraph(layout = \"fr\") + \n  geom_edge_link(aes(width=Weight), alpha=0.2) +\n  scale_edge_width(range = c(0.1, 5)) +\n  geom_node_point(aes(colour = community))  \ng + theme_graph()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](In-class_ex9_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-6-3.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n## Interactive Visualization with visNetwork\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n# Prepare data for visNetwork\nGAStech_edges_aggregated = GAStech_edges %>%\n  left_join(GAStech_nodes, by = c(\"sourceLabel\" = \"label\")) %>%\n  rename(from = id) %>%\n  left_join(GAStech_nodes, by = c(\"targetLabel\" = \"label\")) %>%\n  rename(to = id) %>%\n  filter(MainSubject == \"Work related\") %>%\n  group_by(from, to) %>%\n  summarise(weight = n()) %>%\n  filter(from!=to) %>%\n  filter(weight > 1) %>%\n  ungroup()\n\n# Basic interactive plot\nvisNetwork(GAStech_nodes, GAStech_edges_aggregated)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"visNetwork html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-0b0edfe379247faf9027\" style=\"width:100%;height:464px;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-0b0edfe379247faf9027\">{\"x\":{\"nodes\":{\"id\":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,44,45,46,8,9,10,11,12,13,14,15,16,21,26,17,18,19,20,39,40,41,42,43,27,28,29,47,48,49,50,22,51,52,53,54,23,24,25,30,31,32,33,34,35,36,37,38],\"label\":[\"Mat.Bramar\",\"Anda.Ribera\",\"Rachel.Pantanal\",\"Linda.Lagos\",\"Ruscella.Mies.Haber\",\"Carla.Forluniau\",\"Cornelia.Lais\",\"Kanon.Herrero\",\"Varja.Lagos\",\"Stenig.Fusil\",\"Marin.Onda\",\"Axel.Calzas\",\"Brand.Tempestad\",\"Elsa.Orilla\",\"Isande.Borrasca\",\"Kare.Orilla\",\"Felix.Balas\",\"Lars.Azada\",\"Lidelse.Dedos\",\"Willem.Vasco-Pais\",\"Bertrand.Ovan\",\"Adra.Nubarron\",\"Birgitta.Frente\",\"Gustav.Cazar\",\"Vira.Frente\",\"Linnea.Bergen\",\"Lucas.Alcazar\",\"Isak.Baza\",\"Nils.Calixto\",\"Sven.Flecha\",\"Emile.Arpa\",\"Varro.Awelon\",\"Dante.Coginian\",\"Edvard.Vann\",\"Hennie.Osvaldo\",\"Isia.Vann\",\"Minke.Mies\",\"Sten.Sanjorge.Jr\",\"Felix.Resumir\",\"Hideki.Cocinaro\"